      ":question/problem": "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{3{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+8}}\\,\\text{d}x.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let $u={x}^{3}+8.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3{x}^{2}\\,\u27f9\\,\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u={x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nand we can solve the resulting integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+8}}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+8}}\\cdot {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{u}+C \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{{x}^{3}+8}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
